WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.780
A price goes up 10%, then down 10%.

00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.760
Is it back where it started?

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:09.690
Start at 100.

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.290
Up 10% is 110.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:15.210
10% of 110 is 11.

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.450
So it falls to 99.

00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:21.013
The second change is taken from a bigger number.
